            "sid": "ISA 35:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "¶ Strengthen ye the weak hands, and confirm the feeble knees.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.35.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.35.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 35:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Say to them",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.35.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.35.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "that are",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.35.4",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.35.4"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "of a fearful heart, Be strong, fear not: behold, your God will come",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.35.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.35.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "with",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.35.4",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.35.4"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "vengeance,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.35.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.35.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "even",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.35.4",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.35.4"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "God",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.35.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.35.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "with",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.35.4",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.35.4"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "a recompence; he will come and save you.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.35.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.35.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 35:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then the eyes of the blind shall be opened, and the ears of the deaf shall be unstopped.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.35.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.35.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 35:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then shall the lame",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.35.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.35.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "man",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.35.6",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.35.6"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "leap as an hart, and the tongue of the dumb sing: for in the wilderness shall waters break out, and streams in the desert.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.35.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.35.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 35:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And the parched ground shall become a pool, and the thirsty land springs of water: in the habitation of dragons, where each lay,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.35.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.35.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "shall be",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.35.7",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.35.7"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "grass with reeds and rushes.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.35.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.35.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.35.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.35.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 35:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And an highway shall be there, and a way, and it shall be called The way of holiness; the unclean shall not pass over it; but it",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.35.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.35.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "shall be",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.35.8",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.35.8"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "for those: the wayfaring men, though fools, shall not err",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.35.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.35.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "therein",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.35.8",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.35.8"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.35.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.35.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.35.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.35.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 35:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "No lion shall be there, nor",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.35.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.35.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "any",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.35.9",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.35.9"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ravenous beast shall go up thereon, it shall not be found there; but the redeemed shall walk",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.35.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.35.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "there:",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.35.9",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.35.9"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.35.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.35.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 35:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And the ransomed of the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.35.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.35.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.35.10",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.35.10"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "shall return, and come to Zion with songs and everlasting joy upon their heads: they shall obtain joy and gladness, and sorrow and sighing shall flee away.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.35.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.35.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
